'' Overload choice through 'operator cast': a UDT casting exactly to a number AND to string
'' binds the string overload, as fbc does -- byref or byval string, long or double, and an
'' integer parameter too. tiko called them ambiguous, TKO0660 (audit F-55, SYM-11).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/cast-overload-string-tie.bas -o tests/codegen/castoverloadstringtie.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/castoverloadstringtie.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: u string s3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: w string s3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: y string d4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: z string s3
